1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,731
What does a solution look like?

2
00:00:01,731 --> 00:00:05,247
At every point, the equation tells you a slope.

3
00:00:05,247 --> 00:00:08,398
Draw a little line there: this is the slope field.

4
00:00:08,398 --> 00:00:13,255
A solution is a curve that follows those little lines everywhere.

5
00:00:13,255 --> 00:00:16,901
Start at the top and follow them: you go round a circle.

6
00:00:16,901 --> 00:00:19,726
Every starting point gives a different circle.

